  "prefLabel": "Ed 1021.03 Informal Dispute Resolution",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ed 1021.03 Informal Dispute Resolution.\n\n(a) An individual, or a representative of the individual, seeking review of a determination shall file a complaint with the NHVR.\n\n(b) Filing a complaint shall not prevent the individual from requesting mediation or a due process hearing in the case where the complaint is not resolved to the individual’s satisfaction.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1, #2, and #3 at chapter heading for Ed 1000) #13231, eff 7-13-21",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ed1000.html"
